  "beats": [
    {
      "t": "2026-11-15T00:00:01Z",
      "text": "Non-profit fanfiction repository Archive of Our Own was restored to limited functionality 17 days after being targeted in a cyberattack.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-15:16"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-15T00:00:08Z",
      "text": "The site came back online with limited functionality on 15 November 2026.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1385849964:25"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-15T00:00:15Z",
      "text": "Archive of Our Own, or AO3, is a nonprofit, open-source repository for fanfiction and other fanworks contributed by users.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1385849964:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-15T00:00:25Z",
      "text": "The site is run by Organization for Transformative Works, based in Arlington County, United States.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q27764876:P137"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-15T00:00:33Z",
      "text": "Founded in 2008, the site is owned by Organization for Transformative Works.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q27764876:P571",
        "wd:Q27764876:P127"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-15T00:00:43Z",
      "text": "5 Hacker News stories mentioned Archive of Our Own in the two weeks to 15 November 2026.",
      "cites": [
        "hn:2026-11-15:Q27764876"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-15T00:00:52Z",
      "text": "On 15 November 2026, 860,729 people read about it, about 559× the usual.",
      "cites": [
        "views:en:Archive_of_Our_Own:2026-11-15",
        "views:en:Archive_of_Our_Own:prior"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-15T00:00:59Z",
      "text": "After English, the most readers were in Russian, with 4,954; the article was read in 11 languages.",
      "cites": [
        "views:en:Archive_of_Our_Own:2026-11-15",
        "views:ru:Archive_of_Our_Own:2026-11-15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-15T00:01:06Z",
      "text": "Each language glows where it is mainly spoken, brighter for more readers, though a language is not a country.",
      "cites": [
        "views:ru:Archive_of_Our_Own:2026-11-15",
        "views:de:Archive_of_Our_Own:2026-11-15",
        "views:zh:AO3作品库:2026-11-15",
        "views:es:Archive_of_Our_Own:2026-11-15",
        "views:fr:Archive_of_Our_Own:2026-11-15",
        "views:it:Archive_of_Our_Own:2026-11-15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-15T00:01:16Z",
      "text": "The story was reported by AP.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-15:16"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-15T00:01:24Z",
      "text": "Sources include Wikipedia, Current events, Wikipedia articles, Wikimedia pageviews, Wikidata and Hacker News via the Algolia search API; every caption links to the evidence it rests on.",
